#, python-brace-format
msgid "**Do not alert on ``vault_core_unsealed``.** OpenBao keeps Vault’s metric namespace, and a healthy unsealed node emits ``vault_core_unsealed{cluster=\"\"} 0``, so an alert on ``== 0`` fires permanently. Use ``/v1/sys/health`` (503 while sealed); ``vault_core_active{cluster=\"…\"} == 1`` corroborates."
msgstr "**Neperspėkite ``vault_core_unsealed``.** OpenBao išlaiko Vault 's metric namesspace, ir sveikas nesandarus mazgas išmeta ``vault_core_unsealed{cluster=\"\"} 0``, taigi perspėjimas apie ``== 0`` gaisrai visam laikui. Naudojimas ``/v1/sys/health`` (503 užplombuotas); ``vault_core_active{cluster=\"…\"} == 1`` patvirtinti."

# libretranslate
