# libretranslate
msgid "**Inventory folders.** [init.py](../../../cli/administration/deploy/development/init.py) calls [build_dev_inventory_matrix](../../../cli/administration/deploy/development/inventory/builder.py), which creates one folder per round at `<inventory-dir>-<round>` (or just `<inventory-dir>` when there is a single round). For each folder, `build_dev_inventory` resolves the round's per-app variant payload and bakes it into the inventory's `host_vars` as `applications.<app>: <variant-payload>` overrides. The inventory is therefore variant-resolved on disk; no runtime selector is needed."
msgstr "**Atsargų aplankai.** [init.py](../../../cli/administration/deploy/development/init.py) skambučiai [build_dev_inventory_matrix](../../../cli/administration/deploy/development/inventory/builder.py), kuris sukuria vieną aplanką per turą ne `<inventory-dir>-<round>` (arba tiesiog `<inventory-dir>` kai yra vienas turas). Kiekvienam aplankui, `build_dev_inventory` išsprendžia turo per- app variantas naudingoji apkrova ir pakelia jį į inventoriaus `host_vars` kaip `applications.<app>: <variant-payload>` pereikvoja. Aprašas yra todėl variant- išspręsta diske; nėra kilimo laiko selektoriaus nereikia."

