# libretranslate
msgid "**Mode-selection trigger:** Membership in ``svc-swarm-node`` resolves ``DEPLOYMENT_MODE = swarm`` for every web-app role on that host."
msgstr "**Mode- atrankos gaidukas:** Narystė ``svc-swarm-node`` Išspręsti ``DEPLOYMENT_MODE = swarm`` kiekvienam web-app vaidmeniui tame mazge."

