# libretranslate
msgid "**PDS unreachable:** the broker bubbles up the createAccount or createSession failure and the user sees an HTML error page on the handoff route. Re-trying the visit after PDS recovery completes the handoff."
msgstr "**PDS nepasiekiamas:** brokeris burbuliukai iki CreateAccount arba CreateSeanso gedimo ir vartotojas mato HTML klaidos puslapį ant handoff maršrutą. Re- bando apsilankymą po PDS atkūrimo užbaigia handoff."

# libretranslate
