# libretranslate
msgid "**Persistent model store:** A named volume mounted at `/root/.lmstudio` keeps downloaded models and server settings across redeploys."
msgstr "**Patvari modelio parduotuvė:** Nurodytas tūris, sumontuotas: `/root/.lmstudio` palaiko atsisiųstus modelius ir serverio nustatymus visuose perskirstymuose."

