msgid "The order of those mocks is load-bearing and the router is not what reads it. `AI_AGENT_MODEL` takes `AI_MOCK_ALIASES | first`, so the mock declared first becomes the agent broker's model and its window becomes the context the broker gates platforms on. Declaring the 4096 mock first withheld `hermes`, whose `min_context` is 64000, and the broker's CLI test failed with the reason spelled out. The widest mock therefore leads. A sharper fix would be to have `AI_AGENT_MODEL` pick the mock with the largest declared context instead of the first one, which would make the order irrelevant."
msgstr ""

